                            <div class="icon-circle bg-warning text-white">
                                <i class="fas fa-hands-helping"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="card-title fw-bold mb-2 mb-md-3 small small-md-normal">Collaboration</h4>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">
                            We foster partnerships between medical experts, institutions, and
                            learners to create a vibrant educational community.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="value-card card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-3 p-md-4 text-center">
                        <div class="value-icon mb-2 mb-md-4">
                            <div class="icon-circle bg-danger text-white">
                                <i class="fas fa-heartbeat"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="card-title fw-bold mb-2 mb-md-3 small small-md-normal">Patient-Centered</h4>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">
                            All our educational content ultimately aims to improve patient
                            outcomes and healthcare quality.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="value-card card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-3 p-md-4 text-center">
                        <div class="value-icon mb-2 mb-md-4">
                            <div class="icon-circle bg-purple text-white">
                                <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="card-title fw-bold mb-2 mb-md-3 small small-md-normal">Lifelong Learning</h4>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">
                            We support continuous professional development throughout
                            healthcare careers.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Team Section -->
<section class="team-section section-padding bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-3 mb-md-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Meet Our Leadership</h2>
            <p class="text-muted lead small small-md-normal">The medical experts and visionaries behind our platform</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-3 g-md-4 flex-nowrap flex-md-wrap overflow-auto overflow-md-visible pb-3 pb-md-0">
            <div class="col-10 col-md-4 flex-shrink-0">
                <div class="team-card card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body text-center p-3 p-md-4">
                        <div class="team-image mb-2 mb-md-3">
                            <img src="/images/team-1.jpg" class="rounded-circle" width="80" height="80" alt="Dr. Sarah Johnson" />
                        </div>
